  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">AKCSP- Socio Economic Development Through Conservation of Shah Burj</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is a continuation of the ongoing project for the documentation of picture wall of Lahore Fort.  This phase of the project will be focusing on the conservation of Shah Burt, establishment of Summer Palace Museum; and redesigned tourism management plan for Lahore.  The overall impact of the proposed project is to improve the socio-economic situation and quality of life of the residents and workers of the Walled City of Lahore.</narrative>
  </description>
